OL,3,GNEWSARoad shut as firefighters tackle
OL,4,Alarge grass fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of a main road has been closed as
OL,7,Ffirefighters tackle a large grass fire
OL,8,Fwhich has destroyed several businesses.
OL,10,FAvon Fire and Rescue Service (AFRS) was
OL,11,Fcalled to Locking Farm Industrial
OL,12,FEstate in Weston-super-Mare at 03:03
OL,13,FBST on Tuesday morning. A spokesperson
OL,14,Ffor the service said the number of
OL,15,Fcrews was being scaled back.
OL,17,FThe fire service said the A371 will
OL,18,Fremain closed between the Asda petrol
OL,19,Fstation on Elm Tree Road and the
OL,20,Findustrial estate for most of the day,
OL,21,Fbut the section between Banwell Road
OL,22,Fand Apprentice Way has reopened.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,349,340,200,160,0,100
