OL,3,GNEWSARoad shut as firefighters tackle
OL,4,Alarge grass fire
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Smoke continues to affect the area,
OL,7,Fand local residents should keep windows
OL,8,Fand doors closed to prevent smoke from
OL,9,Fentering homes or businesses," it said.
